  "$comment": "Stickers (bipe ADR 0029, ADR 0033, ADR 0205; bipe-chat/bipe#837). import: the limits for a file that sticker-import or sticker-from-photo adds to a pack, also animated WebP; a WhatsApp animated sticker fits. made: the size of a sticker that Bipe makes (sticker-from-photo now, a GIF from a video later); madeAnimatedMaxMilliseconds is ADR 0205's 3 seconds. Recents and favourites are global account data, lists of { pack, shortcode }, newest first, capped. tagsField is a list of tag ids on an image of an MSC2545 pack. packField on an m.sticker event names its pack room ({ room_id, state_key }), only when the pack is a room pack. Search (rules: stickerSearchFold, stickerQueryTags, stickerMatches in tools/lib/registries.mjs; test-vectors/sticker-search.json) runs on the phone only. words and emoji map a folded word or an emoji to tag ids. A word key is already folded: lower case, no accents, every run of one repeated letter cut to one letter, so kkkk is k and aff is af. An emoji key has no variation selector and no skin tone. Every tag id also matches itself as a word.",
